cudaJitErrorLogBuffer.doc:
Pointer to a buffer in which to print any log messages that reflect errors (the buffer size is specified via option [cudaJitErrorLogBufferSizeBytes](https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/archive/13.4.2/cuda-runtime-api/cuda_runtime_api/group__CUDART__TYPES.html#group__cudart__types_1gga5516e6d5c1b78ac4cb26c203ade11484a6a31af2c1d8c91a1c869bb1aef4120d7)

)

Option type: char \*.

cudaJitInfoLogBuffer.doc:
